# WeatherGPT Frontend Environment Variables
#
# Base URL for the FastAPI backend.
# Default (leave blank or unset) = SAME ORIGIN. In production the built app is served by the
# FastAPI server itself, and in development `npm run dev` proxies /api and /health to
# http://localhost:8000 (see vite.config.ts; override that with VITE_PROXY_TARGET).
# Set a full origin only for a split frontend/backend deployment, e.g.
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com/api
VITE_API_BASE_URL=

# SECURITY: no secrets belong here. API keys / LLM credentials (GROQ_API_KEY, any IMD key)
# live ONLY in the backend environment. The browser only calls the backend and never receives
# key material (see GET /health, which is deliberately secret-free).
